  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 and multiprofile achieve the highest accuracy (0.6501). Multimodal experiments with resnet50 (config_030) underperform, but using a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) may improve results. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 (best RNA encoder) with imagenet_vit_l (better image encoder) in a multiprofile setup, using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of the image encoder while leveraging the best RNA encoder, addressing uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches can outperform RNA-only with improved image features."
